{"translation-revision-date":"2026-03-24 18:00+0100","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.12.0","source":"js\/seating_a.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"da_DK","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);"},"Seating plan created successfully":["S\u00e6deplan oprettet"],"Seating plan updated successfully":["S\u00e6deplan opdateret"],"Seating plan deleted successfully":["S\u00e6deplan slettet"],"Seating plan cloned successfully":["S\u00e6deplan kopieret"],"Seat created successfully":["Plads oprettet"],"Seat updated successfully":["Plads opdateret"],"Seat deleted successfully":["Plads slettet"],"Are you sure you want to delete this?":["Er du sikker p\u00e5, at du vil slette dette?"],"This plan has seats. Delete plan and all seats?":["Denne plan har pladser. Slet plan og alle pladser?"],"Seats created successfully":["Pladser oprettet"],"Limit reached. Upgrade to Premium for unlimited access.":["Gr\u00e6nse n\u00e5et. Opgrader til Premium for ubegr\u00e6nset adgang."],"An error occurred. Please try again.":["Der opstod en fejl. Pr\u00f8v venligst igen."],"Loading...":["Indl\u00e6ser..."],"No seating plans found. Create your first plan!":["Ingen siddeplaner fundet. Opret din f\u00f8rste plan!"],"No seats in this plan. Add seats below.":["Ingen pladser i denne plan. Tilf\u00f8j pladser nedenfor."],"Simple Layout (Dropdown)":["Simpelt layout (dropdown)"],"Customers will see a dropdown menu to select their seat. Available seats are shown in a list sorted by identifier. This is ideal for smaller venues or when visual seat selection is not needed.":["Kunderne vil se en dropdown-menu til at v\u00e6lge deres s\u00e6de. Ledige s\u00e6der vises i en liste sorteret efter identifikator. Dette er ideelt til mindre spillesteder, eller n\u00e5r visuel s\u00e6devalg ikke er n\u00f8dvendigt."],"Visual Layout (Seat Map)":["Visuelt layout (s\u00e6dekort)"],"Customers will see an interactive seat map where they can click on available seats. Occupied seats